# ibex job logs
ibex-records/**/*.out
ibex-records/**/*.err
# Same convention for the workstation: raw run logs stay on disk (local + remote), and the
# substantive content -- per-epoch trajectories, early-stop points, per-assay metrics -- is
# transcribed into the project's record md. The .err files are almost entirely tqdm progress
# bars (73 MB for this project) and carry nothing the .out and the record do not.
workstation-records/**/*.out
workstation-records/**/*.err
